# ...but not the synthetic fixtures the merge tests read. The rule above exists to keep a real
# blind label file, which is the gold key, out of the repository. These three are made up rows
# that have never been near a photo, and without them `make check` is green on the machine that
# happens to have them and red on a fresh clone. It was.
!scripts/tests/fixtures/labels_*.csv

# Local contact sheets of candidate photos. Never deployed, never committed.
photos/candidates/
# Wrangler's local state.
.wrangler/
# Video files are never committed (Update 14). Walk clips are cut from the cache outside the
# repository by scripts/build_walks.py at build time.
*.mp4
*.webm
*.mov
*.mkv
*.ogv
apps/web/public/walks/
